# Ollama Modelfile for the AgriDoc GGUF (local, offline serving).
# Build:  ollama create agridoc -f Modelfile.agridoc
# The GGUF (run-9cp) already carries Qwen2.5's ChatML template with the AgriDoc
# extension-officer persona baked in as the DEFAULT system prompt — so `ollama run agridoc`
# identifies and behaves as AgriDoc (asks when thin, refuses doses, redirects) with no extra
# config. We pin the stop token and a low temperature for a grounded, deterministic contract.
FROM ../model/AgriDoc-Qwen2.5-1.5B-Q4_0.gguf

PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER stop "<|im_end|>"
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
# run-9cp fixed the looping at the model level (it learned to emit EOS), so these are a
# belt-and-suspenders for direct `ollama run` chat. The app sends its own decode params.
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.15
PARAMETER repeat_last_n 256
